// IntroString :
"P2543211845" "I've got a good lead on a Superadine lab the Skulls are running right here in Galaxy City. If we let them continue manufacturing their drug here, it'll mean more dealers on the street and more addicts in the hospital. I can't let that happen. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to destroy the Skulls' Superadine lab.</A> The fate of Galaxy City may well depend on it."
