"P3780963355" "The Skulls are becoming a menace to the streets of Galaxy City. In addition to peddling Superadine, they've been mugging any citizen who they happen across. People are afraid to leave their houses alone, {HeroName}; something has to be done. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to patrol and put a stop to any Skull activity you see.</A>"
